    "title": "Mizzou loses to UNLV in exhibtion",
    "text": "Former Missouri guard Sebastian Mack made sure his old team would not leave Las Vegas with a victory.\nMack scored 19 points to lead UNLV past Missouri 90-81 in an exhibition matchup Thursday night at the Thomas & Mack Center. The Rebels used a strong second-half performance to erase a five-point halftime deficit and hand the Tigers a loss in their final exhibition before the regular season.",
